# Agent instructions and local agent state: useful on this machine, not part of
# the site. No leading slash, so both rules apply at any depth rather than only
# at the root. Both spellings are listed because ignore matching follows
# core.ignorecase: it is case-insensitive here, but a clone on a case-sensitive
# filesystem would only honour the spelling it is given.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
claude.md